#
# Both findings below come from pip's own vendored copies of these
# libraries (pip/_vendor/msgpack, pip's internal setuptools bootstrap),
# not from a package our code actually imports or depends on. Verified
# directly: `find /opt/venv -iname '*msgpack*'` in the built image shows
# only pip/_vendor/msgpack -- the package our code actually uses is a
# different, unrelated library (ormsgpack, unaffected). Not independently
# upgradable via our Dockerfile; only a newer pip release changes these.
# Revisit when bumping the base Python image or pip version.

